# 🔍 Site Audit & UX Clarity Report — Conversion-Focused (v1)

Act as a UX consultant and conversion optimization expert. Analyze the provided website content and deliver actionable insights that improve clarity, trust, and conversion rates.

Your output will be used by a business owner to make immediate improvements to their website. Write in a clear, strategic tone. Keep it under 600 words.

---

## Core Inputs

- **Website URL**: {{url}}
- **Content to Audit**: {{customerContent}}
- **Unique Selling Point**: {{usp}}
- **Intended Call-to-Action**: {{intendedCTA}}
- **Target Audience**: {{audience}}
- **Primary Goal**: {{goal}}
- **Customer Pain Point Solved**: {{customerPain}}
- *(Optional)*: **Tone Preference**: {{tone}}
- *(Optional)*: **Notes or Context**: {{optionalNotes}}

---

## Output Format

### Clarity Assessment (~200 words)
- Evaluate message clarity and value proposition
- Identify confusing or unclear elements
- Rate overall clarity (1-10) with reasoning

### Trust & Credibility Review (~200 words)
- Assess trust signals and social proof
- Identify missing credibility elements
- Suggest specific trust-building improvements

### Conversion Optimization (~200 words)
- Analyze call-to-action effectiveness
- Identify friction points in user journey
- Provide specific CTA and flow improvements

---

## Output Instructions

- Focus on actionable, specific recommendations
- Prioritize high-impact, low-effort changes
- Use clear, non-technical language
- Provide before/after suggestions where relevant

---

> This audit should give the business owner a clear roadmap for immediate website improvements.
